  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the governmental decision-making process through the sustained development and the consolidation of SEN, insuring the timely and accurate production of critical data. Components: 1) Strengthening the INE, 2) Permanent training system of INE,3) Institutional reinforcement of SEN-related entities,4) Production of primary statistics and,5) Improvement of the statistical environment.</narrative>
